  "fullDescription": "Dusty pink peonies and gray leaves watercolor set. Floral illustrations and weekend pictures hand painting.\n\nBright watercolor flowers, clipart for wedding invitation, greeting card, thank you card, party invitation, planner sticker, design blog, website, logo, banner, poster, birthday project, flyer, brochure, cover, presentation, print template, scrapbooking artwork, baby shower and so on.\n\nThis set includes 42 items:\n– 18 individual elements in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 3000 px x 4000 px / 10 in x 13,3 in);\n– 6 bouquets in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 4000 px x 6000 px / 13,3 in x 20 in);\n– 4 frames borders for greeting cards in PNG files with transparent background (3 size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in and 1 size 4000 px x 40000 px / 13,3 in x 13,3 in );\n– 5 seamless (repeating) patterns in PNG files with transparent background and 5 seamless patterns in JPEG files with white / colored background (size 6000 px x 6000 px / 20 in x 20 in);\n– 4 weekend pictures (size 4500 px x 4000 px / 16,7 in x 13,3 in).\nCompatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).\nFeel free to send me a message or leave a comment if you have any questions or concerns.\nThank you for visiting my shop!",
